{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "togglemaster-overview",
  "title": "ToggleMaster - Visão geral",
  "tags": ["togglemaster", "fase4"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },

  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Serviço",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": {
          "refId": "A",
          "query": "label_values({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\"}, exported_job)"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "togglemaster/.*",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] }
      }
    ]
  },

  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Visão geral",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Observabilidade do ToggleMaster",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Provisionado como código pelo GitOps.\n\nMétricas: aplicações → **OTel Collector** → Prometheus. Logs: Collector → **Loki**.\n\nUse o seletor **Serviço** para filtrar. O `analytics-service` consome fila e não tem métrica HTTP — ele aparece na seção *Consumidor assíncrono*."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requisições HTTP",
      "description": "Total de requisições no intervalo do dashboard. Conta as duas famílias de métrica: Go emite http_server_request_duration_seconds, Python emite http_server_duration_milliseconds.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 — pior serviço",
      "description": "Maior p95 entre os serviços selecionados. É o pior caso, e não uma média: somar percentis de serviços diferentes não tem significado.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 10, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "max(histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de erro (5xx)",
      "description": "Respostas 5xx sobre o total. O 'or vector(0)' existe porque sem nenhum 5xx o numerador não casa com série alguma e a divisão volta vazia — é o equivalente ao default_zero() do Datadog.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 14, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "100 * (sum(increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Falha de autenticação (401)",
      "description": "Respostas 401 sobre o total. Separado do 5xx de propósito: 401 é recusa legítima na maior parte do tempo, mas dispara em massa quando a credencial de serviço quebra — que é a falha remediada pelo self-healing.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 19, "y": 1 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "100 * (sum(increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\", http_response_status_code=\"401\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Comparação entre serviços",
      "description": "Uma linha por serviço, no intervalo do dashboard. Os percentis vêm das duas famílias de métrica unidas por 'or': elas cobrem serviços disjuntos, então não há colisão de rótulo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto" } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p50" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "s" }, { "id": "decimals", "value": 3 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p95" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "s" }, { "id": "decimals", "value": 3 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Requisições" }, "properties": [{ "id": "decimals", "value": 0 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Erros 5xx" }, "properties": [{ "id": "decimals", "value": 0 }] },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Taxa de erro" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "percent" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 2 },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Requisições", "desc": true }] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or 0 * sum by (exported_job) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (exported_job) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or 0 * sum by (exported_job) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))) / sum by (exported_job) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "joinByField", "options": { "byField": "exported_job", "mode": "outer" } },
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Time 1": true, "Time 2": true, "Time 3": true, "Time 4": true, "Time 5": true }, "renameByName": { "exported_job": "Serviço", "Value #A": "Requisições", "Value #B": "p50", "Value #C": "p95", "Value #D": "Erros 5xx", "Value #E": "Taxa de erro" } } }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latência",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 por serviço",
      "description": "Duas consultas porque há duas famílias de métrica em unidades diferentes. A de milissegundos é dividida por 1000 para o painel ter uma unidade só.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 0 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))" },
        { "refId": "B", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p99 por serviço",
      "description": "Mesma estrutura do p95. O p99 é o que mostra a cauda — picos que a média e o p50 escondem.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "min": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 0 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval])))" },
        { "refId": "B", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (exported_job, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Throughput e erros",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput por serviço",
      "description": "Requisições por segundo, incluindo as que terminaram em erro.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 70, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}", "expr": "sum by (exported_job) (rate({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput por código HTTP",
      "description": "A mesma vazão, quebrada por código de resposta. É onde um 401 ou um 502 em massa aparece antes de alguém reclamar.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 70, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "HTTP {{http_response_status_code}}", "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa de erro por serviço (%)",
      "description": "Mesma razão dos monitores do Datadog: 5xx sobre total, por serviço. As linhas de 5% e 10% são os patamares de aviso e crítico da ADR 0034.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}}", "expr": "100 * (sum by (exported_job) (rate({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or 0 * sum by (exported_job) (rate({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / sum by (exported_job) (rate({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Respostas fora de 2xx, por serviço e código",
      "description": "Tudo que não é 2xx, separado por serviço e código. Inclui 4xx de propósito: o 401 da credencial quebrada é 4xx, não 5xx.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 70, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}} · {{http_response_status_code}}", "expr": "sum by (exported_job, http_response_status_code) (rate({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\", http_response_status_code!~\"2..\"}[$__rate_interval]))" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Endpoints",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Endpoints por serviço",
      "description": "Quebra por rota. O rótulo é http_route, que é o padrão de rota e não a URL concreta — equivalente ao resource_name do Datadog.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto" } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "p95" }, "properties": [{ "id": "unit", "value": "s" }, { "id": "decimals", "value": 3 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Requisições" }, "properties": [{ "id": "decimals", "value": 0 }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Requisições", "desc": true }] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job, http_route) (increase({__name__=~\"http_server_request_duration_seconds_count|http_server_duration_milliseconds_count\", exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, http_route, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (exported_job, http_route, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "joinByField", "options": { "byField": "http_route", "mode": "outer" } },
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Time 1": true, "Time 2": true, "exported_job 2": true }, "renameByName": { "http_route": "Rota", "exported_job 1": "Serviço", "Value #A": "Requisições", "Value #B": "p95" } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Rotas mais lentas (p95)",
      "description": "As rotas ordenadas por p95. Equivalente ao toplist do Datadog.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 39 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3, "min": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "instant": true, "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}", "expr": "topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (http_route, le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) or histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (http_route, le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000)" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 104,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Consumidor assíncrono — analytics-service",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 48 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Réplicas do analytics-service",
      "description": "O KEDA escala este serviço a zero quando a fila esvazia e o sobe quando há mensagem. Subir do zero é o sinal de que houve consumo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 49 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 60 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "range": true, "legendFormat": "réplicas prontas", "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_ready{namespace=\"togglemaster\", deployment=\"analytics-service\"}" },
        { "refId": "B", "range": true, "legendFormat": "desejadas", "expr": "kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=\"togglemaster\", deployment=\"analytics-service\"}" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Atividade do consumidor (linhas de log por segundo)",
      "description": "Proxy de processamento, medido no Loki. O Prometheus não tem métrica de mensageria: produzido e consumido vêm de spans, e no Datadog quem os conta é o datadog/connector, que não tem equivalente aqui. Ver ADR 0039.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 49 },
